msgstr "Uji Mardia gagal. Pesan galat internal: %s"

msgid ""
"The statistic for skewness is assumed to be Chi^2 distributed and the "
"statistic for kurtosis standard normal."
msgstr ""
"Statistik untuk kecondongan diasumsikan sebagai Chi^2 didistribusikan dan "
"statistik untuk normal standar kurtosis."

msgid "Anti-Image Correlation Matrix"
msgstr "Matriks Korelasi Anti-Gambar"

msgid "Chi-Squared Test"
msgstr "Uji Chi-Kuadrat"

msgid "Degrees of freedom below 0, model is unidentified."
msgstr "Derajat kebebasan di bawah 0, model tidak diidentifikasikan."

